    "detailed_description": "In <strong>No Paint No Gain</strong> you must restore abandoned stations and decorate them to your liking for them you will have tools to do every single thing.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140980/extras/c585c8c85d0193f19694846a47771a52.avif?t=1740481639\" width=500 height=280 /></span><br><br><u>TOOLS</u><br><br>A brush to paint the walls.<br><br>A hammer to fix all the things they have broken.<br><br>A sponge to clean all the graffiti off the walls.<br><br>A scanner to sell objects.<br><br>A spray to paint graffiti.<br><br><strong>TABLET</strong><br><br>On the Tablet you will be able to choose and buy new paints for your walls and floors.<br><br><strong>DECORATION</strong> <br><br>You will also be able to decorate the train stations with new objects.<br><br><strong>PHOTO MODE</strong><br><br>You will be able to take pictures of your restored stations<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140980/extras/06bb15d6e8727dcd6b7a263137b27550.avif?t=1740481639\" width=500 height=280 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "In <strong>No Paint No Gain</strong> you must restore abandoned stations and decorate them to your liking for them you will have tools to do every single thing.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140980/extras/c585c8c85d0193f19694846a47771a52.avif?t=1740481639\" width=500 height=280 /></span><br><br><u>TOOLS</u><br><br>A brush to paint the walls.<br><br>A hammer to fix all the things they have broken.<br><br>A sponge to clean all the graffiti off the walls.<br><br>A scanner to sell objects.<br><br>A spray to paint graffiti.<br><br><strong>TABLET</strong><br><br>On the Tablet you will be able to choose and buy new paints for your walls and floors.<br><br><strong>DECORATION</strong> <br><br>You will also be able to decorate the train stations with new objects.<br><br><strong>PHOTO MODE</strong><br><br>You will be able to take pictures of your restored stations<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140980/extras/06bb15d6e8727dcd6b7a263137b27550.avif?t=1740481639\" width=500 height=280 /></span>",
